			"Message": "style(Grove): Apply consistent blank line formatting across source files\n\nInsert blank lines between logical code blocks across 15 files in the Grove crate to improve readability and maintain consistent styling. Changes include:\n\n- Separate statements and error handling blocks in `Source/API/VSCode.rs`, `Source/Binary/Build/ServiceRegister.rs`, `Source/Common/Traits.rs`\n- Add spacing in `Source/DevLog.rs` within hash generation and OTLP span emission logic\n- Format struct initializations in `Source/Host/ExtensionHost.rs` and `Source/Protocol/SpineActionClient.rs`\n- Add blank lines in transport adapters and implementations across `Source/Transport/` (CommonAdapter, IPCTransport, MistTransport, Strategy, WASMTransport)\n- Insert spacing in WASM runtime components (`Source/WASM/` — FunctionExport, HostBridge, ModuleLoader, Runtime)\n- Format extension loading in `Source/main.rs`\n\nNo functional changes; purely stylistic formatting to align with the organization's Rust code style conventions.",
