			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Consolidate public module declarations\n\nRemove blank lines between public module declarations in `Source/Library.rs` to follow a compact declaration style. The modules `API`, `Common`, and `Services` are no longer exported.\n\nThis streamlines the crate's public API surface, retaining only `Binary`, `DevLog`, `Host`, `Protocol`, `Transport`, and `WASM` as exposed modules.",
